    {
      "rank": 4,
      "row_id": 411655,
      "chunk_id": "b9da035a98e9_0",
      "doc_id": "b9da035a98e9",
      "text": "More storage, but battery not as long lasting as the 3a. I had a Pixel 3a for two years, which I loved, but needed more storage. So I got this one with 128 mb of storage, which is great! The camera takes wonderful photos, just clean the lens with an alcohol wipe once in a while. My only caution is that the battery life is poor. It can last all day if I am not streaming or using the map app, but otherwise it's dead by 2:00pm. No facial recognition, unless you mean of faces in photos.",
