    {
      "rank": 9,
      "row_id": 381008,
      "chunk_id": "e92d04cd78b8_0",
      "doc_id": "e92d04cd78b8",
      "text": "Going back to Samsung. Battery life and storage are a huge problem. My Samsung S7 battery had diminished life so I was looking for something at least better than that, but a brand new pixel doesn't last any longer. I'm plugging in around 3pm every day. There is hardly any storage and no way to expand, so you're married to the Google cloud, which is only free for another couple of months and then you either pay monthly or accept photos and video of extremely diminished quality, which defeats the purpose of the Pixel altogether. I'm going back to Samsung, I can't stand one more minute with this pixel. Also, my \"brand new\" one came with dead pixels.",
      "score": 0.0320856102003643,
