      "doc_id": "fde535f080d6",
      "text": "Love my Pixel 3- Battery life is meh but otherwise awesome!. Love the phone, have shot gigs and gigs of videos with it. Battery life is not impressive but is adequate. Shooting video is about the hardest thing you can do to use up the battery though. It will overheat sometimes when I am shooting video and need to cool down before I can continue.",
