    {
      "rank": 14,
      "row_id": 294318,
      "chunk_id": "76653034c155_1",
      "doc_id": "76653034c155",
      "text": "Other than that, my only other semi-minor complaints are: (1) battery life should be better, (2) the side buttons are too hard to push. So much so that I created a volume settings shortcut on my home page and (3) while better than any I've had, the camera still doesn't TAKE photos as fast as an Apple. I still get blur on photos with slow-ish movement; I'm talking aboutn animal moving around, not someone running or driving away.",
