      "chunk_id": "8c8c1bd46144_0",
      "doc_id": "8c8c1bd46144",
      "text": "Poor battery life. I got one for 400$ from Google on the April sale for Google Fi users. For this price it is good. The biggest complain is the battery life. I bought it mainly for the camera to use on a holiday trip. It barely managed to last a day while walking, taking pictures and using maps.",
